{
  "uid": "artf-sim",
  "title": "ARTF sim \u00b7 RTBlint guardrail",
  "description": "What to watch on this hop: drop rate vs the dirty mix, mutations p99 vs 150ms tmax, shed at zero, and whether drops fail at mutations or after apply. Auction series are the mixer. RPC series are real rtblint-grpc.",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "artf",
    "rtblint"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "liveNow": true,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read this first",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**This hop, not a QPS trophy.** Drop rate tracks the mix you planted: near zero on a clean run, near the dirt on a dirty one. Suppress and shade still forward. **p99** of `ValidateArtfMutations` must stay far under the **150ms tmax** dashed line. **Shed > 0** means the limiter refused work to keep that clock. **gate=mutations** = agent never pointed at this auction. **gate=applied** = patch wrote illegal OpenRTB. Synthetic mix, real gRPC, laptop slice."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Auctions / s",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(artf_sim_auctions_total[10s]))"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "semi-dark-green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drop rate",
      "description": "Tracks the mix you planted. Near zero on a clean run. Red means more than the mixer.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 2
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(artf_sim_auctions_total{outcome=\"drop\"}[10s])) or vector(0)) / clamp_min(sum(rate(artf_sim_auctions_total[10s])), 0.0001)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "semi-dark-green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "semi-dark-orange",
                "value": 0.13
              },
              {
                "color": "semi-dark-red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      }
    },
    {
